question,answer
What are your working hours?,"Our working hours are Monday to Friday, 9 AM to 6 PM."
How can I contact customer support?,You can contact customer support through email or phone.
What payment methods do you accept?,"We accept credit cards, debit cards and online payments."
How can I create an account?,You can create an account by clicking the Sign Up button.
How can I reset my password?,You can reset your password using the Forgot Password option.
Do you provide refunds?,"Yes, refunds are available according to our refund policy."
How can I cancel my order?,You can cancel your order from your account before it is shipped.
How long does delivery take?,Delivery usually takes 3 to 5 business days.
Where can I track my order?,You can track your order using the tracking option in your account.
How can I contact you?,You can contact us through our official support email.
How can I place an order?,"Select the product you want, add it to your cart and complete the checkout process."
Can I change my delivery address?,"Yes, you can change your delivery address before your order is shipped."
Is there a delivery charge?,Delivery charges may vary depending on the order and delivery location.
What should I do if my order is late?,Please check the order tracking information or contact customer support.
What should I do if I receive a damaged product?,Contact customer support and provide details about the damaged product.
Can I return a product?,"Yes, eligible products can be returned according to our return policy."
How long does a refund take?,Refund processing time may vary depending on the payment method.
Can I change my order after placing it?,You may change your order before it is processed or shipped.
How do I check my order history?,You can view your previous orders from the Order History section of your account.
Do I need an account to place an order?,An account may be required to place and manage your orders.
